# Westerly Winds (ToAU 7, mission.toau.westerly_winds). A level 75 Warrior of Bastok with it current, status 0, in Aht
# Urhgan Whitegate (the Teahouse area 5, 64 -7 -137 .. 95 -5 -123, to its south): Cacaroon 3023, Nadeey 3025, Naja 3021
# (the mercenary rank 0); area 5: 3027, finished with room: the Raillefal's Note, an Imperial Silver Piece, Agent of
# the Allied Forces, status 1. Status 1: Cacaroon and Nadeey nothing; area 5 again nothing; Naja 3028, its updates
# (option 1: updateEvent(2, 1, ...); option 2: 0), finished: completed (the Silver Piece, A Mercenary Life current),
# the note deleted, A Mercenary Life's must-zone flag set.
lists AhtUrhganWhitegate/Cacaroon/onTrigger AhtUrhganWhitegate/Nadeey/onTrigger AhtUrhganWhitegate/Naja_Salaheem/onTrigger AhtUrhganWhitegate/onTriggerAreaEnter/5 AhtUrhganWhitegate/onEventUpdate/3028 AhtUrhganWhitegate/onEventFinish/3027 AhtUrhganWhitegate/onEventFinish/3028
char zone=AhtUrhganWhitegate pos=80,-6,-140 job=WAR lvl=75 nation=1
mission Asa BurgeoningDread current
mission Acp ACrystallineProphecyFin current
mission Rov ARhapsodyForTheAges current
mission Soa Abomination current
mission Toau WesterlyWinds current
login
tick 1000
tick 1000
tick 1000
trigger Cacaroon                        # 3023
finish
trigger Nadeey                          # 3025
finish
trigger Naja_Salaheem                   # 3021
finish
walk 80,-6,-140
walk 80,-6,-130                         # area 5: 3027
finish                                  # the note, the piece, the title, status 1
trigger Cacaroon                        # status 1: nothing
finish-if-event
trigger Nadeey                          # nothing
finish-if-event
walk 80,-6,-140
walk 80,-6,-130                         # status 1: nothing
walk 80,-6,-140
trigger Naja_Salaheem                   # 3028
update 3028 option=1                    # updateEvent(2, 1, ...)
update 3028 option=2                    # updateEvent(0, 1, ...)
finish                                  # completed; the note deleted; must zone
